         <p><strong>TONE</strong> goes from DARK through FULL to THIN. Below FULL it cuts highs; above FULL it cuts lows from what enters the wet effect. The dry sound stays intact. ROOM also keeps a low cut at FULL to stop bass building up in their tails.</p>
