         <h3>Master punch effects</h3>
         <p>Hold <kbd>FX</kbd> and press a key to apply one of SLOOP’s 27 audio effects to the whole stereo master, including shared returns and USB stereo capture. Release the effect key for dry audio. Double-tap FX to lock the layer and tap again to close. KNOB 1 browses the key reference. Keys held before FX keep playing; effect keys produce no notes or MIDI.</p>
         <p>The effects include loops, reverse, tape stop, half speed, filter sweeps, phone, crush, alias, gate, echo, wobble, band kills, rewind, octave up, flanger, auto-pan, freeze, mono and fade. FREEZE uses SLOOP Reverb to hold 186 ms of captured master audio. The optional punch history uses 32 KiB while the layer is in use (372 ms of mono history; replay spans up to 348 ms); hold FX briefly before reverse/rewind. If memory is unavailable the header shows FX MEMORY; close FX, reduce effect memory use and reopen to retry.</p>
